abstract: >
  KHIS Toolkit is a Kenya-first Python analytics toolkit for extracting,
  cleaning, validating, forecasting, and visualising routine DHIS2/KHIS county
  health data. It covers all 47 Kenya counties, supports malaria and
  mental-health indicator workflows, generates county data quality scorecards,
  produces Prophet and ensemble forecasts, and ships a county-level Streamlit
  dashboard designed for use in county health review meetings and research pipelines.
